description:
We're a growing digital marketing agency in Dundee, Scotland, offering web design & marketing services for a variety of clients, in a variety of niches. We get new clients on a regular basis and we're looking to grow our team by building a relationship with a talented web developer.

We're looking for someone who is 'hungry' for work, highly motivated, organized, detail oriented, communicates well & regularly and is able to juggle between multiple projects.

The ideal candidate must be fluent in English and also fluent with:
- Wordpress (and other CMS optional);
- CSS, HTML, PHP, Javascript & basic programming languages;
- DNS/hosting & migrating websites;
- designing beautiful mockups, converting .PSD to HTML to Wordpress;
- advanced custom fields;
- building custom themes.

We're seeking a long term business relationship if you join our team. The job is ideal for someone who is dependable, independent - enjoys working with little direction, detail oriented and a team player.

Please do waste either of our time if you represent other workers or are a project manager. We are looking to work with someone directly, and reward well.

If you're interested in this awesome job opportunity, you must fit the above criteria, submit a portfolio in response to this post, and also respond with what is your favorite color. We wont be responding to anyone who does not answer this question.

Thank you!
